        "tier": "now",
        "order": 8,
        "title": "Change passwords, starting with email",
        "what": "Change your email password first, then your bank and payment apps. Use a different password for each account. Turn on the extra sign-in step (a code sent to your phone) wherever it is offered.",
        "why": "Email is the master key. Most password resets flow through it.",
        "note": "Write each new password down and store it somewhere safe at home.",
